WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:40.610
Glemy's underling August teamed up with
the Blue Corps to take over Ghardaïa.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:43.490
Even Glemy probably never expected that.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:48.570
But thanks to that, we were
able to bring Roux back.

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:52.200
I don't know anything about
that weird artist, though.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.290
I guess he'd be Roux's personal problem.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:02:00.500
ACROSS THE SALT LAKE

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:19.240
Lady Haman, this ship will
soon arrive at Kilimanjaro.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.660
Princess Mineva, I must be going.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:35.620
My elder sister devoted herself to the Zabi
family and died in the far reaches of space.

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.000
But I am not going to die.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.870
I will add new blood
to the Zabi family...

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:44.550
and surely revive it,
as the Neo Zabi family.

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:50.620
And as for you, Char...

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:55.850
You allowed the will of your father,
Zeon Deikun, to be used by the Zabi family.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.260
While you took a detour by yourself...

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.570
I've been always alone.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.000
So hot!

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.580
Hey, Judau. When are we
going to reach the Argama?

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:24.710
I want to take a shower soon!

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.010
Hang in there.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:30.380
It's so hot! I'm going to die!

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.090
It's the sea!

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:33.690
You're right!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.940
Hurray! I can bathe there!

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:44.270
Hurry up, Judau!

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:47.570
This is strange... have we already
reached the Mediterranean?

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:48.880
What are you talking about?

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.190
That isn't the sea... It's a lake!

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.030
Look closely!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.960
It's Chott Melrhir.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:56.370
It really looks like the sea, though!

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:01.080
That means the Argama must be close.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.220
They did say they were resupplying
at the shore of Chott Melrhir.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.790
Let's stop! Let's stop here, Judau!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.940
We need to meet up
with the Argama first!

00:04:09.940 --> 00:04:13.650
Everyone is exhausted.
Judau, let's take a little break!

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:16.010
Elle, you said something
brilliant! I love you!

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:18.480
Hurry, Judau! Hurry!

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.650
Oh, fine...

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:29.280
- What a nice breeze!
- Oh, really?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.330
So beautiful!

00:04:36.010 --> 00:04:40.000
Salty! Elle, you liar!
This isn't a lake!

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:43.290
This is a salt lake.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.290
A salt lake?

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:47.670
Yes, a lake made of salt water.
So of course it's going to be salty.

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:49.690
I see!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:54.560
Wow, it's like I'm in space.
My body feels so light!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.380
Let's go!

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.680
- All right!
- Here goes!

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.270
All right!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.470
Let's go, Roux.

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:03.430
You're kidding me!

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.810
You trying to look cool?

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:08.730
Just try taking a dip in salt water
when you can't take a shower after.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.860
You'll end up sticky all over.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.200
You're such a poser!

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:20.450
Enemies!

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.750
Everyone, come back! Enemies incoming!

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:25.050
- What?
- Over there!

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.460
I've found you!

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:33.090
Gundams!

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:37.130
There are pipelines along both sides
of the lake, so I knew you'd pass by here!

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:41.260
Commander, let's return to the Mindra
and call for reinforcements.

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:44.470
No way! We should shoot down
one or two of them first.

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:50.360
Now that Glemy's back, I'll lose my position
if I can't ring him a souvenir.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.410
- Roux, the smoke screen.
- Roger!

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.610
What?! Only children?!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.080
But--!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.210
Judau!

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:15.390
I'm not going down without
firing a single shot!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.260
Double Zeta!

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.850
Like that could hit me!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.740
Into the lake with you
and your mobile suit!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.620
What?!

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.400
Damn you!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.750
Beecha!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.920
Tch! I'll be back.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.710
Beecha, don't follow him further.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:56.800
Judau! Since when do
you outrank everybody?!

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:57.930
What was that?

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.380
Judau!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.310
Is everyone okay?

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:09.560
Judau, good job!

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.440
That's our Judau!
Great work!

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.520
What a Newtype!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.730
Neo Zeon is no match for you!

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:18.320
Judau this, Judau that.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:22.160
I could do just as well, if I were
piloting the Double Zeta.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:29.040
Maintain it carefully.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.640
I won't be making another
sortie for a while.

00:07:30.640 --> 00:07:33.050
What do you mean by that, August?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.890
Master Glemy!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:40.220
If you spot the Gundam Team, I would
expect you to pursue and destroy them.

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:44.290
I felt the strength of the
Gundams with my own body.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:47.110
I realized why they've
defeated us in the past.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:50.060
August... what are you saying?

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.850
Nothing, really.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.410
It's all pointless unless we have
a strategy for defeating them.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.150
Damn you.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:59.740
Did you see it?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.590
Did you look while I was gone?

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:06.710
With all due respect, sir,
I could never do such a thing!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.130
Come with me!

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:23.850
Once you've seen this, you must
follow me until the day you die.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:30.770
I've been keeping the Newtype corps
in reserve because I don't believe...

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:36.740
the AEUG, represented by the Argama, or the Earth Federation were our true enemies.

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.780
T-This is... cold sleep?

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:44.290
Correct. I've had them hibernating
for have a year now.

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:56.750
They're the vanguard of my Newtype corps.
Warriors I have raised with great care.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:59.170
But... they're children...

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:01.930
Age does not matter for Newtypes.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:04.920
I see.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:08.510
You said that the Argama
is not the true enemy.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:11.000
So who is?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:15.730
Haman ordered you to
keep me under observation.

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:17.860
Can you betray Haman...?

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:23.070
After seeing these Newtypes...
I fear you, Master Glemy.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:26.840
Do you believe in the lineage
of the Zabi family, August?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:30.290
Lineage? You mean... blood ties?

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:37.220
Did you ever wonder why Haman was
pampering a fledgling like me?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.790
Master Glemy...?

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.800
What will you do now? Will you
report all of this to Haman...

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.680
and then die at the hands
of my Ple-Two?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:56.180
Glemy Toto, my principle is to follow
the strong and go with the flow.

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:59.690
How can you lower yourself so much?
Do you fear for your life?

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:03.070
No, it's because justice
belongs to the strong.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:07.200
I would give my life to follow
that path to the end.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:11.410
Then give your life to me
for the revival of the Zabi family.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:12.790
Yes, sir!

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:38.770
Before you head to the
Karaba base in Norway...

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.450
We want you to go to Dublin.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.190
There should be Federation leaders there
who made it out of Dakar...

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:48.250
right before Neo Zeon
seized control.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:52.350
Understood. I'll try to negotiate
with them directly.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:56.880
I'd like to know why they're
letting Karaba do all the fighting.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:01.370
The enemy has a vague idea
of what is in Dublin by now.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.700
It seems that Haman
is pretty shrewd.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:09.060
As soon as the Gundam Team
rejoins us, we'll be on our way.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.300
What is it?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.230
What?! An enemy attack?!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.440
You're sure that the Gundam Team
hasn't joined them yet!?

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:28.360
Yes, sir!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.450
In that case...

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:42.000
It's time to sink, Argama!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.730
Not for Haman, not for Glemy...
but for MY sake!

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.710
Torres! Damage report!

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.560
Captain! You're all right!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:50.800
Of course.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:55.190
All hands, intercept them!
Keep the damage reports coming!

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:01.680
Judau... where are you guys
fooling around?!

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.500
I want to take a shower!

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:26.010
I feel sticky! I want a bath!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.420
You can't! Just hang in there
until we get to the Argama!

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:33.470
I should have listened to Roux, too!

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:36.050
Beecha! Why are you sulking?

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.760
It's nothing!

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:39.640
You're weird, Beecha.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.710
That really was weird.

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:47.430
That attack earlier, I mean. Retreating
after one attack feels pretty unnatural.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.020
Roux's on lookout. Want me
to ask her how things are?

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:52.090
- Please do!
- Okay! Roux!

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.740
See anything unusual?

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:57.760
Our radar's dead 'cause
the Argama's so close. Look carefully.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:13:00.290
Roux! Are you listening?!

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.750
N-Nothing unusual!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.430
No, I take that back!
There's something strange!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:12.130
Isn't that the Argama's direction?
I see smoke!

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:14.380
Those guys went after the Argama!

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.800
Take a rest down there!

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.680
What are you doing?!

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:19.050
Hold on, Beecha!

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:22.060
Judau can fight better
because of his machine!

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:24.980
So If I pilot the Double Zeta,
I can be a hero, too!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:27.490
Beecha! You can't handle it!

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:31.120
I can't let Judau strut around
with a big head forever!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.610
Beecha!

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.040
Elle! Let me borrow the Mk. II!

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:40.370
Beecha!

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:42.790
If you keep being selfish,
you're gonna die!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:47.920
Why is Beecha heading out
in the Double Zeta?!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:58.630
You think youc an make your Mk. II
cross the lake?

00:13:58.630 --> 00:13:59.970
No, I can't!

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:02.760
My plan involved you being helpful!

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:04.810
Fine, hop on!

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:06.930
Hey!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.060
Iino, wait a sec! I'll fly this.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:11.400
Why?

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:13.970
I'll let you handle the Zaku Tanker!

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.450
Leave Judau to me!

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.830
Mondo! Let me on board!

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:28.120
Just as I'd expect, the Argama is tough.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:30.130
But how long will you last?!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.880
Can't we use our comms yet?

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.760
Judau's group should
be pretty close by now!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.650
You're here, Double Zeta!

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.650
Sorry to keep you
waiting, Captain Bright!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:58.160
I'll show this hick mobile suit team
the power of the Double Zeta!

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.580
So it showed up after all!

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:09.760
If I flinch, luck will elude me.
I'll seize that luck with my own hands!

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:17.920
In a shallow lake like this, I can
see you clearly, even if you dive!

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:25.400
Who needs Ple-Two?! Who needs Newtypes?!
Are we grown men really so useless?!

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:46.040
I can take care of this myself.
Sink the Argama!

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:48.370
Beecha!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.160
Is the entire Gundam Team here now?

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:53.840
I'll get them, Commander!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.150
Argh! How dare you?!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.900
- Elle, get the Double Zeta!
- Roger!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.620
Beecha, are you all right?!

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:27.170
I was just caught off guard!
The Double Zeta is fine! I can do it!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:33.580
It looks like the Double
Zeta has been hit.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.260
Argama, do you copy?!

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.630
Judau, what's wrong?

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:40.850
- I'm not the one piloting the Double Zeta!
- What?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.680
I'll explain later.
Send out the Hyaku Shiki!

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.140
Send out WHAT?!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:52.680
The Hyaku Shiki, send the Hyaku Shiki!
I'm not in a mobile suit right now!

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:54.780
Judau! Enemy, from the right!

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:01.660
Captain Bright, hurry!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:05.200
Astonaige! Launch the
Hyaku Shiki on a sled!

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.910
Launch it?! But we don't have a pilot!

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:09.630
That's fine! Launch it unmanned!

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.790
It's coming in!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.960
Wha?! Move, dammit!

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.830
The verniers are dead?!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:25.050
Judau!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:29.020
Why are you calling for Judau?!
I'm right here!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.480
Beecha!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.520
Judau, it's on its way!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.130
Roger!

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.530
Fire cannons toward the lake!
Give Judau some cover!

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:50.620
Ple, take over piloting!
Get us close to that sled!

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:51.870
Leave it to me!

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.550
I don't like this enemy...
It's too creepy!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.790
Commander, it looks like the enemy
has launched a mobile suit!

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.930
What?!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.600
Don't just watch!
Shoot it down!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:14.900
You won't get in Judau's way
with a girl like me backing him up!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.110
Ple, just a little bit more! Go lower!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.650
Judau, it's the enemy!

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:26.540
Never mind them!
Now, a little to the left!

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.110
All right!

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:37.040
The engine's at critical...
Good job, Captain Bright!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.420
Let's go, Ple!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:51.190
Launching that fragile golden
thing won't save you!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.890
Judau...!

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:02.610
I-I'm sorry, they got me!

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:07.160
If I pull back now,
luck will forsake me...

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.700
I once had the Mindra
under my command!

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:16.240
I can't allow myself to be
defeated by the likes of you!

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:18.460
What the hell's this guy talking about?

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.670
I know that attack pattern already!

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.300
You're going down!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:31.180
Not yet!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.650
I-I can't believe I'm beaten!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.860
The Mindra will be
in my hands again--!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.780
They got Master August?!

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:54.710
Everyone, retreat!

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.220
Judau, you're so strong!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:08.140
Only because you did
so well, Ple. Thanks!

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.810
Is everyone else all right?
What happened to Beecha?!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.150
Hey!

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.430
Why did you do something
so selfish, Beecha?

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:24.070
Shut up! It has nothing
to do with you, Elle!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.810
It has plenty to do with me!

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:28.870
You caused everyone lots of trouble!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.900
I just launched faster than all you
guys would've done together.

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:35.660
If I didn't go out there,
the Argama would have sunk!

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:39.630
You're in no position to brag,
doing all this damage to the Double Zeta!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.960
You'd be dead too,
if I hadn't protected you!

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:45.220
Lies!

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:57.560
August Guidan... it seems that
luck was not on your side.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:01.470
People cannot live by strength alone.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:05.560
And I don't plan to defeat
Haman merely with strength...

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.200
Make contact with Kilimanjaro.

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:11.900
Have them deliver our
follow-up mobile suits!

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:14.410
- Can we use laser communications?
- Yes, sir.

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:21.990
Looks like fixing this will take all night.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:26.300
Jeez! You break things in an instant,
and then it takes forever to repair them.

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:27.920
I'm sorry.

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:30.460
Well, all's well if
you guys are all right.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:33.310
Machines can always be repaired.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:38.000
Elle said she wanted to
apologize to you, Beecha.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.350
Elle's not that straightforward, either.

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:42.350
Actually, she's grateful to you.

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:44.900
Heh, we'll see about that.

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:50.780
Judau, I guess the Double Zeta
isn't much good without you.

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:56.090
When you put it so bluntly,
it's embarrassing!

00:21:56.090 --> 00:22:00.870
That thing is so attuned to your quirks
that it's really hard to pilot.

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:04.580
You take it without asking,
and you have to say things like that?!

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:06.790
Beecha's a bit embarrassed, too.

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:10.170
He's finally recognized your abilities.

00:22:10.170 --> 00:22:11.840
He's kinda cute, isn't he?

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:13.020
Judau!

00:22:13.020 --> 00:22:16.880
Let's take showers!
The captain said we can use water!

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:17.840
All right!

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:20.020
Then, let's all go take one!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:45.970 --> 00:23:51.040
As the Argama finally lifts off, a new
mobile suit team comes chasing after it.

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:54.970
And after we shake them off,
Captain Bright lands in Dublin.

00:23:54.970 --> 00:23:59.140
He's there to protest against some guys
who want to decommission the Argama!

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:00.970
I'm gonna protest, too!

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:05.340
But then I'm engulfed in smoke...
ugh, my eyes are watering!

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:08.640
Next time on Gundam ZZ:
"Afternoon in Dublin."

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
Next Time

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
AFTERNOON IN DUBLIN

00:24:09.240 --> 00:24:11.230
Are you... Miss Fa Yuiry?!
